 },
 "html": "<p><strong>Outlier</strong> é uma observação muito distante das demais. Ele pode ser um <strong>erro</strong> (digitação, unidade errada), um <strong>caso legítimo raro</strong> (um cliente muito grande) ou um sinal de <strong>outra população</strong> misturada nos dados.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"destaque\">\n<p>Detectar é técnico. <strong>Decidir o que fazer</strong> depende do conhecimento do negócio.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"secao-7-1\">7.1 Método IQR (cercas de Tukey)</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> marca como outlier todo valor abaixo de <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>·</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></math> ou acima de <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>·</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></math>. É o mesmo critério do boxplot, com <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></math> = parâmetro <code>whis</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> é o método padrão por ser robusto, já que não depende da média. Use <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></math> como padrão e <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math> para pegar só os casos extremos.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">limites_iqr</span>(serie, k=<span class=\"tk-num\">1.5</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Retorna os limites inferior e superior das cercas de Tukey.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    q1, q3 = serie.<span class=\"tk-fn\">quantile</span>([<span class=\"tk-num\">0.25</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">0.75</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    iqr = q3 - q1</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> q1 - k * iqr, q3 + k * iqr</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">lim_inf, lim_sup = <span class=\"tk-fn\">limites_iqr</span>(df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">outliers_iqr = df[(df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] &lt; lim_inf) | (df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] &gt; lim_sup)]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Limites: [</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>lim_inf<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>lim_sup<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">]</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Outliers (IQR): </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(outliers_iqr)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> (</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(outliers_iqr) / <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(df)<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.1%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">Limites: [18.85, 158.28]\nOutliers (IQR): 37 (3.7%)</pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Visualmente: o parâmetro whis do boxplot é o mesmo k</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">fig, axes = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(ncols=<span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">14</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>), sharex=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">boxplot</span>(data=df, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, whis=<span class=\"tk-num\">1.5</span>, ax=axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>]).<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">whis = 1,5 (padrão)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">sns.<span class=\"tk-fn\">boxplot</span>(data=df, x=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, whis=<span class=\"tk-num\">3.0</span>, ax=axes[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>]).<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_title</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">whis = 3,0 (só extremos)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Dois boxplots horizontais de coluna_num_2 com o mesmo eixo x: à esquerda com whis = 1,5, que marca vários pontos como outliers; à direita com whis = 3,0, que marca só os extremos.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Dois boxplots horizontais de coluna_num_2 com o mesmo eixo x: à esquerda com whis = 1,5, que marca vários pontos como outliers; à direita com whis = 3,0, que marca só os extremos.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"505\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/notebook/celula-121.webp\" width=\"1670\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button></figure></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-7-2\">7.2 Método Z-score</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> marca como outlier todo valor a mais de 3 desvios padrão da média (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>).</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> apenas em distribuições <strong>aproximadamente normais</strong>.</p>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p>Os próprios outliers inflam a média e o desvio padrão, o que pode \"esconder\" outros outliers. Em dados assimétricos, prefira o IQR, ou aplique o Z-score sobre o log da variável.</p></div></aside>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">z = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">zscore</span>(df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>], nan_policy=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">omit</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">outliers_z = df[np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">abs</span>(z) &gt; <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Outliers (|Z| &gt; 3): </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(outliers_z)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">Outliers (|Z| &gt; 3): 9</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-7-3\">7.3 Inspeção dos casos extremos</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> lista os maiores e menores valores e as linhas completas desses registros.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre, antes de decidir o que fazer. Olhe as outras colunas desses registros para entender se são erro ou caso legítimo.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df.<span class=\"tk-fn\">nlargest</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">10</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)        <span class=\"tk-com\"># 10 maiores (nsmallest para os menores)</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_id</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_ordinal</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_binaria</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num_2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_valor_texto</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_data_fim</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_multivalor</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_valor</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_num_ausente</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat_agrupada</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">contem_item_1</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_total</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">flag_cat_a</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">nivel</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">faixa_num</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">log_coluna_num</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">z_coluna_num</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">184</th>\n<td class=\"num\">185</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>Baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">16.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">771.42</td>\n<td class=\"num\">32,20</td>\n<td>2024-07-04</td>\n<td>2024-07-13</td>\n<td>item_3</td>\n<td class=\"num\">32.20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">803.62</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>10-20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.83</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">615</th>\n<td class=\"num\">616</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">13.20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">609.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">674,97</td>\n<td>2024-07-22</td>\n<td>2024-07-22</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">674.97</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,283.97</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>10-20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.58</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.42</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">713</th>\n<td class=\"num\">714</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">530.94</td>\n<td class=\"num\">722,92</td>\n<td>2024-11-05</td>\n<td>2024-11-15</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_3</td>\n<td class=\"num\">722.92</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,253.86</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>0-5</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.61</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.76</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">701</th>\n<td class=\"num\">702</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">8.80</td>\n<td class=\"num\">509.40</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.403,50</td>\n<td>2024-03-31</td>\n<td>2024-04-07</td>\n<td>item_3;item_4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3,403.50</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3,912.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>5-10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.17</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">4</th>\n<td class=\"num\">5</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">6.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">438.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.154,87</td>\n<td>2024-06-24</td>\n<td>2024-06-29</td>\n<td>item_2</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,154.87</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,592.87</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>5-10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.93</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.49</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">127</th>\n<td class=\"num\">128</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">428.52</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.585,00</td>\n<td>2024-12-17</td>\n<td>2024-12-31</td>\n<td>item_2;item_4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3,585.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,013.52</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>0-5</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.61</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.76</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">301</th>\n<td class=\"num\">302</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">10.90</td>\n<td class=\"num\">395.40</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.497,63</td>\n<td>2024-08-09</td>\n<td>2024-08-20</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2;item_4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,497.63</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,893.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>10-20</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2.39</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.09</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">802</th>\n<td class=\"num\">803</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">65.70</td>\n<td class=\"num\">324.35</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.447,10</td>\n<td>2024-11-28</td>\n<td>2024-12-12</td>\n<td>item_1;item_2</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,447.10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,771.45</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.19</td>\n<td class=\"num\">7.98</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">86</th>\n<td class=\"num\">87</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Médio</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">41.10</td>\n<td class=\"num\">257.26</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.883,13</td>\n<td>2024-12-02</td>\n<td>2024-12-13</td>\n<td>item_4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4,883.13</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">5,140.39</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td class=\"num\">3.72</td>\n<td class=\"num\">4.44</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">199</th>\n<td class=\"num\">200</td>\n<td>Não informado</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>Baixo</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">221.39</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.536,66</td>\n<td>2024-10-17</td>\n<td>2024-10-17</td>\n<td>item_1;item_3;item_4</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,536.66</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td>Não informado</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,758.05</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0</td>\n<td>acima_mediana</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n<td class=\"num\">NaN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">limite_negocio = <span class=\"tk-num\">500</span>                   <span class=\"tk-com\"># limite definido pelo conhecimento do negócio</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">(df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] &gt; limite_negocio).<span class=\"tk-fn\">value_counts</span>()   <span class=\"tk-com\"># quantos registros passam do limite</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">coluna_num_2\nFalse    996\nTrue       4\nName: count, dtype: int64</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-7-4\">7.4 Tratamento</h2>\n<div aria-label=\"7.4 Tratamento\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Estratégia</th>\n<th>Código</th>\n<th>Quando usar</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Manter</strong></td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>outliers legítimos e relevantes; use medidas robustas (mediana, IQR, Spearman, testes não paramétricos)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Remover</strong></td>\n<td><code>df[df['col'] &lt;= limite]</code></td>\n<td>erro comprovado ou fora do escopo da análise; <strong>reporte quantos foram removidos</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Limitar (winsorizar)</strong><span class=\"selo selo--complemento\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\" title=\"Técnica que não estava no material de estudo original\">Complemento</span></td>\n<td><code>df['col'].clip(lower, upper)</code></td>\n<td>manter o registro, mas reduzir sua influência</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Transformar</strong></td>\n<td><code>np.log(...)</code> (Seção <a href=\"/preparar/limpeza-e-tratamento/#secao-4-9\">4.9</a>)</td>\n<td>cauda longa natural (renda, preço)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Analisar à parte</strong></td>\n<td><code>df[df['col'] &gt; limite]</code></td>\n<td>quando os extremos formam outro grupo (Seção <a href=\"/explorar/analise-bivariada-e-multivariada/#secao-8-5\">8.5</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">df_sem_outliers = df[df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">between</span>(lim_inf, lim_sup)].<span class=\"tk-fn\">copy</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2_limitada</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>] = df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">clip</span>(lower=lim_inf, upper=lim_sup)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-com\"># Medir o impacto da decisão</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">impacto = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">com outliers</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: df[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mean</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">median</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">std</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">sem outliers</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: df_sem_outliers[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">agg</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">count</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">mean</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">median</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">std</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">impacto</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">com outliers</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">sem outliers</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">count</th>\n<td class=\"num\">1,000.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">963.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">mean</th>\n<td class=\"num\">94.71</td>\n<td class=\"num\">88.54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">median</th>\n<td class=\"num\">86.98</td>\n<td class=\"num\">85.86</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">std</th>\n<td class=\"num\">49.24</td>\n<td class=\"num\">26.28</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>O que observar</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><ul>\n<li>A <strong>média</strong> e o <strong>desvio padrão</strong> mudam muito com outliers. A <strong>mediana</strong> praticamente não muda. Uma grande diferença entre as duas colunas acima indica o peso dos extremos.</li>\n<li>Outliers distorcem correlação e regressão (Seção <a href=\"/inferir/regressao-linear/#secao-13-2\">13.2</a>). Sempre compare os resultados com e sem eles.</li>\n<li>As cercas de Tukey funcionam melhor em dados <strong>simétricos</strong>. Em dados assimétricos, elas marcam \"outliers\" que são apenas a cauda natural. Escolha <code>k</code> pelo conhecimento dos dados.</li>\n<li>Nunca remova outliers só para \"melhorar\" um resultado.</li>\n</ul></div></aside>\n",
